Package: hinglishpy
Version: 4.1.0
Architecture: aarch64
Maintainer: termux-learn-crypto <vilasrmeshram400@gmail.com>
Section: interpreters
Priority: optional
Description: Native HinglishPy interpreter (C)
 HinglishPy - Python jaisa language, keywords Hinglish me. C me likha
 tree-walking interpreter: zero dependencies, Python ki zarurat nahi.
 Supports bolo, agar/nahito/warna, jabtak, har, kaam, varg (classes),
 koshish/pakdo/ant (exceptions), batao (generators), match, lambdas,
 list/dict/tuple, f-strings.
 .
 Command: hinglishpy file.hl
